    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "Good evening, and tonight right here, the ABC News exclusive, the first network interview with President Donald Trump. Just five days in, we traveled to the White House today, and this evening, President Trump, on his new executive order to build the wall, what he told me about torture, waterboarding, about his plan to suspend immigration from certain countries. We also asked about the millions concerned about losing their health care, and the President's belief that there were millions of illegal votes on Election Day. the president taking us through his new home tonight, the People's House, our interview with President Donald Trump. Mr. President, I know you're only five days in. Has it changed you?",
