    "turn_text": "He says a lot of problems and President Trump tonight on the controversial moves he's made already. Mr. President, I want to start with five days in. and your campaign promises. I know today you plan on signing the order to build the wall. Correct. Are you going to direct US funds to pay for this wall? Will American taxpayers pay for the wall?",
