    "turn_text": "Well, I do, but I have to also say, we just had an election a few weeks ago. And they voted, in many cases. In some cases, they didn't vote, I imagine. And we did have an election. With that being said, absolutely have responsibility to everybody, including people that didn't vote for Donald Trump. Totally.",
